{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>בא החלום.</b> When a dream is mixed from many matters, it is known that it is from the mixture of foods, and when one of the four roots overpowers, it has no interpretation and indicates neither good nor evil, for it is vanity. So does the fool resemble, who multiplies words, and all who multiply words in any place bring sin, even in a place designated to mention the exalted Name in it always:"], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:39.933012114Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}